   "sourceHash": "235ce891a6e84a908d004c889d9e430e17741b87119ffd7e14eaf905f7d158d2",
   "text": "关于[[OPEN_1]]瘫痪康复与复健疗法[[CLOSE_1]]",
   "status": "translated",
